WEBVTT

00:32:53.663 --> 00:33:01.163
It's to be genuinely interested in what
your collaborator is say, and, you know,

00:33:01.163 --> 00:33:04.246
I am quite competitive. I'm
also quite competitive.

00:33:04.246 --> 00:33:07.079
We were not competitive when
we worked together.

00:33:07.788 --> 00:33:13.746
The joy of love, of collaboration
for me always was that.

00:33:14.413 --> 00:33:18.413
But that almost that was more with them
than with almost anyone else.

00:33:18.704 --> 00:33:22.621
I would say something and he would
understand it better than I had.

00:33:23.163 --> 00:33:26.621
And that's the greatest
joy of collaboration.

00:33:26.913 --> 00:33:28.788
But in my other collaborations,

00:33:29.413 --> 00:33:36.121
taking pleasure in the ideas of your
collaborator seemed to be very useful,